{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>\n\n</p>\n<p>久夛良木健表示，他理解玩家對實體遊戲以及所有權的感受。索尼此前已經公佈相關安排，但這項變化不會立即生效，而是將在數年後實施。</p>\n<p>圍繞數字遊戲所有權，美國眾議員Ritchie Torres準備提出一項相關法案。他主張，消費者應當有權擁有、遊玩和轉讓自己購買的遊戲。</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"久夛良木健支持PlayStation逐步淘汰實體遊戲光盤\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20261017/1792198969_191233.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>同期公佈的另一則消息與電影《新蝙蝠俠2》有關。華納兄弟宣佈由Steven Soderbergh接替Matt Reeves執導，Matt Reeves因個人事務離開導演崗位，但計劃在影片後期製作階段回歸。</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"久夛良木健支持PlayStation逐步淘汰實體遊戲光盤\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20261017/1792198968_545038_jpg_r.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"久夛良木健支持PlayStation逐步淘汰實體遊戲光盤\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20261017/1792198969_191233.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T06:59:02.243026+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":232,"images":3,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T06:48:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T23:58:06.894838+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T06:57:36.725582+00:00","content_hash":"781ce33b3f1e0872685ecdf83a1fdb3cd13db6e249e4cd3d5686fc40dfd8627a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}